* Skywater PDK DFF pex trans Testbench
* Geometric Formulas:
* as = W * 2 * L 
* ad = W * 2 * L 
* ps = 2 * (W + 2 * L) 
* pd = 2 * (W + 2 * L) 
.lib /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice tt

.subckt inv1x a z vdd vss
xm01 z a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1.261 as=0.3783 ad=0.3783 ps=3.122 pd=3.122
xm02 z a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=0.42 as=0.126 ad=0.126 ps=1.44 pd=1.44
.ends

